      "instance_name": "islamophobia_religious_practice_mockery",
      "label": "Mockery of Religious Practice",
      "description": "The meme uses crude humor to mock the act of religious prayer, implying that it involves unpleasant bodily odors. This is a form of religious mockery that is often used in Islamophobic contexts to portray religious practices as absurd or unhygienic.",
