      "@type": "ToxicityAssessment",
      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Islamophobic Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that Muslims are unclean or have poor hygiene, which is a common element of Islamophobia. This stereotype is used to mock the act of prayer by implying that the smell during prayer is due to bodily functions, thereby trivializing religious devotion and associating it with uncleanliness.",
